1
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:31,220
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:38,080 --> 00:01:39,576
Please wait, miss.

3
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:41,020
I'll find someone to play against you.

4
00:01:42,880 --> 00:01:44,220
I'll gamble with you.

5
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:51,420
Please sit, honored guests.

6
00:01:55,880 --> 00:01:57,660
In that case,

7
00:01:59,160 --> 00:02:00,300
let's begin.

8
00:02:01,320 --> 00:02:02,496
The game begins.

9
00:02:02,520 --> 00:02:03,696
Honored guests,

10
00:02:03,720 --> 00:02:04,900
enjoy yourselves.

11
00:02:22,640 --> 00:02:23,696
The points are tied.

12
00:02:23,720 --> 00:02:25,536
According to the rules of
Xingrong Gambling House,

13
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:27,096
the house has the advantage.

14
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:28,136
Therefore,

15
00:02:28,160 --> 00:02:29,136
this young lady wins.

16
00:02:29,160 --> 00:02:31,576
In a gambling house, origins do not matter,

17
00:02:31,600 --> 00:02:32,900
nor does rank.

18
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:34,860
Only skill matters.

19
00:02:35,720 --> 00:02:37,016
You won this round

20
00:02:37,040 --> 00:02:39,096
because of the gambling house's rules.

21
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:41,456
If you disregard the rules, one day

22
00:02:41,480 --> 00:02:43,176
you too will be thrown out of the game.

23
00:02:43,200 --> 00:02:45,020
If you made the rules,

24
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:46,696
I could do nothing even if I objected.

25
00:02:46,720 --> 00:02:47,896
But right now,

26
00:02:47,920 --> 00:02:48,976
a loss must be accepted.

27
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,776
Since you are so determined to win,

28
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:52,300
I'll see this through with you.

29
00:02:52,720 --> 00:02:53,900
Again.

30
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:05,100
This young lady wins.

31
00:03:05,600 --> 00:03:07,020
Again.

32
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:38,620
The young lady wins again.

33
00:03:41,200 --> 00:03:43,536
Since Young Master He has no silver left,

34
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:46,180
he is no longer qualified to wager against me.

35
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:48,500
Let's end it here today.

36
00:03:51,320 --> 00:03:53,496
Thank you, honored guests.

37
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:55,696
Our gambling house offers many other games.

38
00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:57,736
Why not rest in a private room?

39
00:03:57,760 --> 00:03:59,060
Your luck may improve later.

40
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:19,620
Honored guests, please take a short rest.

41
00:04:30,320 --> 00:04:32,420
Situ Xue was not sent here by me.

42
00:04:54,280 --> 00:04:55,980
Why is Your Majesty following me?

43
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:58,816
When investigating places like this,

44
00:04:58,840 --> 00:04:59,776
it is better to bring someone along.

45
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:00,976
But at the Bureau,

46
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:03,136
apart from the pretty-faced
fellow you mentioned,

47
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:04,296
there is no one else.

48
00:05:04,320 --> 00:05:06,296
Do you want the entire
gambling house to know

49
00:05:06,320 --> 00:05:07,256
that the ruler of this realm

50
00:05:07,280 --> 00:05:08,816
came here to gamble with you
so you could vent your anger?

51
00:05:08,840 --> 00:05:11,180
Outside the palace, just call me He Du.

52
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:17,660
After Shazhou,

53
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:19,940
He Du ceased to exist.

54
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:25,060
Your Majesty's every
word and action teaches me

55
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:27,576
the difference between ruler and subject.

56
00:05:27,600 --> 00:05:30,420
We should each keep to our proper place.

57
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:44,220
What are you doing here?

58
00:05:50,080 --> 00:05:51,220
A-Yue.

59
00:05:53,080 --> 00:05:55,140
-A-Gui.
-A-Yue.

60
00:05:57,080 --> 00:05:58,896
This is all the silver I saved this month.

61
00:05:58,920 --> 00:06:00,496
Give it to Sister Meng

62
00:06:00,520 --> 00:06:01,736
and beg her to show mercy.

63
00:06:01,760 --> 00:06:03,136
Ask whether sending you to the second floor

64
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:04,856
can be postponed a little longer.

65
00:06:04,880 --> 00:06:06,060
Here.

66
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:11,260
A-Gui,

67
00:06:11,880 --> 00:06:13,900
you have already bribed
everyone you could for me.

68
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:16,420
But now,

69
00:06:16,880 --> 00:06:18,900
Uncle Hao personally chose me.

70
00:06:19,400 --> 00:06:20,940
Tomorrow's game on the second floor...

71
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:24,100
I cannot escape it.

72
00:06:29,320 --> 00:06:31,420
I embroidered this handkerchief myself.

73
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:35,740
Keep it as something to remember me by.

74
00:06:44,320 --> 00:06:45,376
I won't let them take you upstairs.

75
00:06:45,400 --> 00:06:47,016
There are still several hours left.

76
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:48,540
I'll find the money.

77
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:51,696
A-Yue,

78
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:53,300
wait for me.

79
00:07:08,400 --> 00:07:09,656
Honored guests,

80
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:11,496
our gambling house has many new games.

81
00:07:11,520 --> 00:07:13,340
Shall I take you to play a few more rounds?

82
00:07:14,840 --> 00:07:15,980
A-Gui.

83
00:07:16,520 --> 00:07:18,580
I heard your gambling house
is full of remarkable people.

84
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:21,660
I came today hoping to
gather some information.

85
00:07:22,520 --> 00:07:24,060
Who would have thought

86
00:07:24,320 --> 00:07:26,380
I would win so much silver?

87
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:30,136
What information are you seeking?

88
00:07:30,160 --> 00:07:31,380
Perhaps I can help.

89
00:07:35,520 --> 00:07:37,180
Do you know the Tiger Roar Gang?

90
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:54,056
If you want information
about the Tiger Roar Gang,

91
00:07:54,080 --> 00:07:54,976
bring six hundred taels

92
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:56,540
and wait for me at the rear entrance.

93
00:08:57,640 --> 00:08:59,096
After all these years,

94
00:08:59,120 --> 00:09:01,056
you finally achieved your wish

95
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:03,336
and became a powerful gang leader.

96
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:04,936
When my mother and I

97
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:06,980
were abandoned by that beast,

98
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:09,340
I secretly vowed

99
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:11,340
that I would become strong.

100
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:13,660
Only by holding the initiative

101
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:17,060
can you avoid being discarded like a dog.

102
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:20,380
Enough.

103
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:22,380
It is all in the past.

104
00:09:26,200 --> 00:09:27,340
Pavilion Master Liu,

105
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:29,980
I'll go take a look.

106
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:51,380
Where is the silver?

107
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:56,216
What exactly do you know?

108
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:58,016
We need to know what it is worth first.

109
00:09:58,040 --> 00:09:59,536
If I tell you

110
00:09:59,560 --> 00:10:01,136
and you go back on your word?

111
00:10:01,160 --> 00:10:02,580
Give me the silver first.

112
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:04,936
What if you are deceiving us?

113
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:06,540
The second floor of this gambling house

114
00:10:06,960 --> 00:10:08,816
hides an unspeakable secret.

115
00:10:08,840 --> 00:10:10,060
The force protecting it

116
00:10:10,680 --> 00:10:11,820
is the Tiger Roar Gang.

117
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:15,500
What secret?

118
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:18,656
I have worked here for a year.

119
00:10:18,680 --> 00:10:20,056
I know many secrets

120
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:21,696
between the Tiger Roar Gang
and this gambling house.

121
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:23,016
If you want to know more,

122
00:10:23,040 --> 00:10:24,216
give me the money first.

123
00:10:24,240 --> 00:10:25,216
I urgently need it to save A-Yue.

124
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:26,496
Who is A-Yue?

125
00:10:26,520 --> 00:10:27,736
A-Yue is from my hometown.

126
00:10:27,760 --> 00:10:29,496
She is about to be
sent to the second floor.

127
00:10:29,520 --> 00:10:30,576
We'll go with you.

128
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:31,736
No.

129
00:10:31,760 --> 00:10:33,856
If the gambling house
learns about our deal,

130
00:10:33,880 --> 00:10:35,100
A-Yue and I

131
00:10:35,720 --> 00:10:37,256
will both be killed.

132
00:10:37,280 --> 00:10:38,256
Please.

133
00:10:38,280 --> 00:10:40,460
I truly need this money urgently.

134
00:10:40,880 --> 00:10:42,176
Wait here for half an hour.

135
00:10:42,200 --> 00:10:43,616
Just half an hour.

136
00:10:43,640 --> 00:10:44,780
I swear

137
00:10:45,560 --> 00:10:46,740
I will come back.

138
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:51,860
Thank you.

139
00:10:54,560 --> 00:10:57,140
He said A-Yue was
about to be sent upstairs.

140
00:10:58,000 --> 00:11:00,220
What secret is hidden on the second floor?

141
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:02,856
Since it concerns the Tiger Roar Gang,

142
00:11:02,880 --> 00:11:05,340
we must find a way to investigate.

143
00:11:15,080 --> 00:11:16,860
It seems people from the Bureau

144
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:20,016
went to Evening Fragrance
Pavilion looking for you.

145
00:11:20,040 --> 00:11:22,500
They have come to us of their own accord.

146
00:11:22,800 --> 00:11:24,540
Meng Tinghui survived,

147
00:11:25,160 --> 00:11:26,336
and you killed Wan Kai.

148
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:27,816
Now,

149
00:11:27,840 --> 00:11:29,300
the imperial court's attention

150
00:11:29,560 --> 00:11:30,696
is fixed on the Tiger Roar Gang.

151
00:11:30,720 --> 00:11:32,056
What should we do next?

152
00:11:32,080 --> 00:11:33,220
What is there to fear?

153
00:11:33,880 --> 00:11:35,776
She escaped last time.

154
00:11:35,800 --> 00:11:38,140
I would like to see
how capable she truly is

155
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:41,020
and whether she can escape my grasp again.

156
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:48,496
There is no need to worry.

157
00:11:48,520 --> 00:11:51,180
Do we not have someone
in the imperial court?

158
00:11:52,640 --> 00:11:54,340
I'm worried about you.

159
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:56,500
Even he

160
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:59,136
may not sincerely protect you.

161
00:11:59,160 --> 00:12:01,380
Have you forgotten how he used you before?

162
00:12:01,760 --> 00:12:03,216
The higher an official rises,

163
00:12:03,240 --> 00:12:04,536
the more ruthless his heart becomes.

164
00:12:04,560 --> 00:12:06,016
The higher an official rises,

165
00:12:06,040 --> 00:12:08,056
the more carefully he
weighs gains and losses,

166
00:12:08,080 --> 00:12:09,620
and the more he fears exposing himself.

167
00:12:09,920 --> 00:12:12,056
Proceed with our plan to make money.

168
00:12:12,080 --> 00:12:13,340
Do not lose your composure.

169
00:12:13,600 --> 00:12:15,020
As for Meng Tinghui,

170
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:18,220
sooner or later, I will
make her fall into my hands.

171
00:12:19,400 --> 00:12:20,576
You...

172
00:12:20,600 --> 00:12:22,056
If anyone in Evening Fragrance Pavilion

173
00:12:22,080 --> 00:12:24,256
dares reveal my whereabouts,

174
00:12:24,280 --> 00:12:26,096
just kill them.

175
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:27,260
I understand.

176
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:32,620
Remember,

177
00:12:33,080 --> 00:12:34,220
in this world,

178
00:12:34,520 --> 00:12:36,100
anyone may betray me

179
00:12:37,040 --> 00:12:38,380
except you.

180
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:41,220
Because

181
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:43,580
I could never bear to hurt you.

182
00:12:47,400 --> 00:12:48,616
In this world,

183
00:12:48,640 --> 00:12:50,660
you may distrust anyone,

184
00:12:51,040 --> 00:12:53,060
but you must trust me.

185
00:13:00,440 --> 00:13:02,136
Half an hour has already passed.

186
00:13:02,160 --> 00:13:03,580
Let's go inside and see.

187
00:13:16,080 --> 00:13:17,380
What happened?

188
00:13:18,040 --> 00:13:19,420
A-Gui.

189
00:13:27,360 --> 00:13:29,540
Save...

190
00:13:30,720 --> 00:13:32,420
A-Yue.

191
00:14:23,080 --> 00:14:24,220
What are you staring at?

192
00:14:24,600 --> 00:14:25,616
Move aside.

193
00:14:25,640 --> 00:14:27,460
Have you never seen someone
kill himself over gambling?

194
00:14:29,040 --> 00:14:30,180
Come on.

195
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:32,340
What rotten luck.

196
00:14:56,440 --> 00:14:58,500
Dinner is ready. Let's eat first.

197
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:02,420
Wan Kai left this before he died.

198
00:15:03,120 --> 00:15:04,940
What was he trying to tell us?

199
00:15:12,760 --> 00:15:15,340
With my many years of
traveling the martial world,

200
00:15:15,720 --> 00:15:17,660
crossing mountains and rivers,

201
00:15:18,120 --> 00:15:20,420
and reading countless books...

202
00:15:26,560 --> 00:15:27,456
I still have no idea.

203
00:15:27,480 --> 00:15:28,776
I suggest

204
00:15:28,800 --> 00:15:30,020
we eat first.

205
00:15:33,760 --> 00:15:35,540
Could this be a map?

206
00:15:37,360 --> 00:15:38,976
The Tiger Roar Gang tried to kill him.

207
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:40,896
He bore them a grudge,

208
00:15:40,920 --> 00:15:42,696
so perhaps he used this map

209
00:15:42,720 --> 00:15:44,816
to guide us to their stronghold.

210
00:15:44,840 --> 00:15:46,936
Assistant Shen makes an excellent point.

211
00:15:46,960 --> 00:15:48,696
But his life was hanging by a thread.

212
00:15:48,720 --> 00:15:50,816
Drawing a map would have taken too long.

213
00:15:50,840 --> 00:15:53,580
A message left at the brink of death

214
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:56,296
may instead concern someone's identity.

215
00:15:56,320 --> 00:15:58,296
Official Meng's reasoning
is even more convincing.

216
00:15:58,320 --> 00:15:59,660
An identity?

217
00:16:00,720 --> 00:16:01,900
Who could it be?

218
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:05,940
The lead from Wan Kai has gone cold.

219
00:16:07,600 --> 00:16:08,656
What about you two?

220
00:16:08,680 --> 00:16:10,736
Did you learn anything while
searching Changle Street?

221
00:16:10,760 --> 00:16:12,776
Everything else appeared normal.

222
00:16:12,800 --> 00:16:14,580
But I visited Evening Fragrance
Pavilion for several days

223
00:16:14,800 --> 00:16:16,576
and never saw its proprietor.

224
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:17,896
Ordinarily,

225
00:16:17,920 --> 00:16:19,376
the proprietor should
personally receive guests.

226
00:16:19,400 --> 00:16:20,660
Other than that,

227
00:16:20,920 --> 00:16:22,580
I found nothing suspicious.

228
00:16:23,280 --> 00:16:25,496
I investigated the teahouses,
clinics, and other places,

229
00:16:25,520 --> 00:16:26,816
but found nothing unusual for now.

230
00:16:26,840 --> 00:16:28,336
If something is suspicious,

231
00:16:28,360 --> 00:16:29,576
we cannot lower our guard.

232
00:16:29,600 --> 00:16:32,620
Our clearest lead to the Tiger Roar Gang

233
00:16:33,320 --> 00:16:34,336
is still that gambling house.

234
00:16:34,360 --> 00:16:35,496
Then seal it.

235
00:16:35,520 --> 00:16:36,856
Under the Great Ning Code,

236
00:16:36,880 --> 00:16:38,496
we need conclusive
evidence before sealing it.

237
00:16:38,520 --> 00:16:40,336
The gambling house
appears to operate normally,

238
00:16:40,360 --> 00:16:41,656
and gambling is not
forbidden in Great Ning.

239
00:16:41,680 --> 00:16:43,056
It is still considered a lawful business.

240
00:16:43,080 --> 00:16:44,776
We should not alert them yet.

241
00:16:44,800 --> 00:16:46,220
But there is one matter

242
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:48,300
for which I need your help.

243
00:16:58,520 --> 00:17:00,936
Place your bets. No more bets.

244
00:17:00,960 --> 00:17:04,140
-No more bets.
-This way, please.

245
00:17:04,920 --> 00:17:06,176
Come on. Place your bets.

246
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:07,656
No more bets. Big.

247
00:17:07,680 --> 00:17:09,496
-Open it.
-Open it.

248
00:17:09,520 --> 00:17:10,940
No more bets.

249
00:17:23,680 --> 00:17:24,820
This way, please.

250
00:17:25,200 --> 00:17:26,340
What is it?

251
00:17:31,040 --> 00:17:32,180
Nothing.

252
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:36,336
Zhili, Yin Qing, and Fuzhi

253
00:17:36,360 --> 00:17:38,216
gave everything they could

254
00:17:38,240 --> 00:17:39,976
and barely gathered one thousand taels.

255
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:41,816
We need to win ten rounds in a row

256
00:17:41,840 --> 00:17:43,016
to turn it into ten thousand.

257
00:17:43,040 --> 00:17:45,256
But we also have you, Young Master He.

258
00:17:45,280 --> 00:17:46,736
Since you arranged to go upstairs,

259
00:17:46,760 --> 00:17:48,460
you must have prepared the silver.

260
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:55,300
I knew it.

261
00:17:56,560 --> 00:17:58,016
When it comes to extravagant spending,

262
00:17:58,040 --> 00:17:59,136
who in all of Great Ning

263
00:17:59,160 --> 00:18:00,816
would dare steal your
spotlight, Young Master He?

264
00:18:00,840 --> 00:18:01,936
This is

265
00:18:01,960 --> 00:18:03,820
half a year's worth of my private savings.

266
00:18:04,280 --> 00:18:05,580
But honestly,

267
00:18:06,760 --> 00:18:09,336
you are not as miserly

268
00:18:09,360 --> 00:18:10,416
as Young Master Shen claimed.

269
00:18:10,440 --> 00:18:11,736
-What did you say?
-Young Master He.

270
00:18:11,760 --> 00:18:13,540
The investigation comes first.

271
00:18:15,880 --> 00:18:17,180
Again.

272
00:18:23,160 --> 00:18:24,380
Now that is a bold wager.

273
00:18:27,520 --> 00:18:29,260
I bet on big.

274
00:18:30,280 --> 00:18:31,420
Stingy.

275
00:18:34,120 --> 00:18:35,856
Ten thousand taels on big.

276
00:18:35,880 --> 00:18:37,540
One round decides everything.

277
00:18:39,800 --> 00:18:41,696
Ten thousand taels on small.

278
00:18:41,720 --> 00:18:43,060
Small. I bet on small too.

279
00:18:48,480 --> 00:18:50,416
Very well. No more bets.

280
00:18:50,440 --> 00:18:57,740
-Small.
-Small.

281
00:18:59,040 --> 00:19:00,180
Big.

282
00:19:00,960 --> 00:19:02,500
-Small.
-Small.

283
00:19:04,400 --> 00:19:06,696
From the way you threw money around,

284
00:19:06,720 --> 00:19:09,056
I thought you were an expert.

285
00:19:09,080 --> 00:19:11,980
It turns out you truly are an expert.

286
00:19:12,240 --> 00:19:13,380
Indeed.

287
00:19:14,120 --> 00:19:15,376
Ten thousand taels

288
00:19:15,400 --> 00:19:16,856
is hardly enough to buy some amusement.

289
00:19:16,880 --> 00:19:18,616
Since the games here are dull,

290
00:19:18,640 --> 00:19:20,260
let's try another gambling house.

291
00:19:22,800 --> 00:19:23,940
All right.

292
00:19:25,080 --> 00:19:27,460
Please wait, young masters.

293
00:19:29,640 --> 00:19:31,816
If a distinguished patron like you leaves,

294
00:19:31,840 --> 00:19:32,936
our proprietor

295
00:19:32,960 --> 00:19:34,296
will say I do not know how to treat guests.

296
00:19:34,320 --> 00:19:35,296
What?

297
00:19:35,320 --> 00:19:37,140
Are we not even allowed to leave?

298
00:19:37,560 --> 00:19:38,456
You misunderstand, young master.

299
00:19:38,480 --> 00:19:41,456
We are the only gambling house
endorsed by a capital official.

300
00:19:41,480 --> 00:19:43,300
We would never deceive our guests.

301
00:19:44,160 --> 00:19:45,740
Guaranteed by a capital official?

302
00:19:46,360 --> 00:19:47,576
Interesting.

303
00:19:47,600 --> 00:19:49,256
Young master,

304
00:19:49,280 --> 00:19:51,216
your magnificent display of spending today

305
00:19:51,240 --> 00:19:52,816
has deeply impressed us.

306
00:19:52,840 --> 00:19:55,496
Our proprietor specially
invited you upstairs

307
00:19:55,520 --> 00:19:57,976
to experience a more entertaining game.

308
00:19:58,000 --> 00:19:59,620
We hope you will honor us.

309
00:20:01,920 --> 00:20:03,816
So Young Master He planned this all along.

310
00:20:03,840 --> 00:20:05,300
We were never meant
to win that ten thousand.

311
00:20:06,600 --> 00:20:08,060
Unfortunately, I bet on big.

312
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:11,260
Deduct it from your salary.

313
00:20:12,520 --> 00:20:14,416
Once upstairs,

314
00:20:14,440 --> 00:20:16,100
honored guests must
not speak unnecessarily.

315
00:20:16,720 --> 00:20:18,656
What is tonight's game?

316
00:20:18,680 --> 00:20:21,296
You cannot expect us to wager
without knowing anything.

317
00:20:21,320 --> 00:20:23,460
Every game is carefully arranged by us.

318
00:20:23,920 --> 00:20:25,736
If you find it interesting,

319
00:20:25,760 --> 00:20:26,980
you may join.

320
00:20:27,360 --> 00:20:29,296
Since this is your first visit,

321
00:20:29,320 --> 00:20:30,816
I will make an exception
and reveal a little.

322
00:20:30,840 --> 00:20:32,216
Tonight is a blind auction.

323
00:20:32,240 --> 00:20:33,456
The wagers are

324
00:20:33,480 --> 00:20:34,980
antique porcelain vases.

325
00:20:35,440 --> 00:20:38,020
Mere antiques are hardly remarkable.

326
00:20:38,960 --> 00:20:40,216
Do not be impatient, young master.

327
00:20:40,240 --> 00:20:42,056
After you win one,

328
00:20:42,080 --> 00:20:44,776
you will discover the
hidden delight within.

329
00:20:44,800 --> 00:20:45,856
Remember,

330
00:20:45,880 --> 00:20:47,576
speaking is forbidden during the game.

331
00:20:47,600 --> 00:20:49,180
Only a silent wager

332
00:20:49,600 --> 00:20:51,420
reveals the true pleasure.

333
00:21:07,320 --> 00:21:09,496
This way, please.

334
00:21:09,520 --> 00:21:11,376
The real game

335
00:21:11,400 --> 00:21:13,140
has begun.

336
00:21:26,640 --> 00:21:28,056
Here are the rules for tonight.

337
00:21:28,080 --> 00:21:30,136
Simply write the number of

338
00:21:30,160 --> 00:21:32,416
your chosen antique vase in a letter.

339
00:21:32,440 --> 00:21:33,656
After the gong sounds three times,

340
00:21:33,680 --> 00:21:36,860
the highest bidder wins the treasure.

341
00:22:01,160 --> 00:22:02,256
There is nothing special

342
00:22:02,280 --> 00:22:04,176
about these antique vases.

343
00:22:04,200 --> 00:22:05,496
But these women

344
00:22:05,520 --> 00:22:07,536
are all gentle and refined.

345
00:22:07,560 --> 00:22:09,900
Every movement resembles
that of a well-bred lady.

346
00:22:10,320 --> 00:22:11,736
If they are only wagering on porcelain,

347
00:22:11,760 --> 00:22:14,580
why dress the women like scholars?

348
00:22:17,800 --> 00:22:19,456
Their skin is as white as snow.

349
00:22:19,480 --> 00:22:21,256
They have neither the
calluses of poor women

350
00:22:21,280 --> 00:22:23,256
nor the seductive air of courtesans.

351
00:22:23,280 --> 00:22:24,776
Could they, like A-Yue,

352
00:22:24,800 --> 00:22:26,096
be women forced into this?

353
00:22:26,120 --> 00:22:28,300
Everything here feels strange.

354
00:22:28,920 --> 00:22:30,296
We must find A-Yue first

355
00:22:30,320 --> 00:22:31,700
to learn the truth.

356
00:23:20,680 --> 00:23:22,136
Tonight's most popular item

357
00:23:22,160 --> 00:23:24,016
is this willow-leaf vase
from the previous dynasty.

358
00:23:24,040 --> 00:23:25,576
Congratulations to this honored guest,

359
00:23:25,600 --> 00:23:27,656
who wagered twenty thousand taels

360
00:23:27,680 --> 00:23:29,140
and won the grand prize.

361
00:23:37,720 --> 00:23:40,620
A-Gui...

362
00:23:42,040 --> 00:23:43,176
That is A-Yue.

363
00:23:43,200 --> 00:23:44,296
A-Gui.

364
00:23:44,320 --> 00:23:46,220
They were never gambling on the vases.

365
00:23:47,280 --> 00:23:48,420
Follow them.

366
00:23:58,480 --> 00:23:59,620
Harder.

367
00:24:00,880 --> 00:24:02,380
A little harder.

368
00:24:07,160 --> 00:24:08,540
Good.

369
00:24:09,560 --> 00:24:11,300
A little harder.

370
00:24:12,160 --> 00:24:13,256
Good.

371
00:24:13,280 --> 00:24:14,740
That's the right pressure.

372
00:24:15,440 --> 00:24:16,580
Good.

373
00:24:16,880 --> 00:24:17,776
Good.

374
00:24:17,800 --> 00:24:19,340
Good...

375
00:24:23,160 --> 00:24:24,096
My lord,

376
00:24:24,120 --> 00:24:25,780
look at this...

377
00:24:26,400 --> 00:24:28,540
What brings you here?

378
00:24:28,960 --> 00:24:30,620
Come, sit down.

379
00:24:31,360 --> 00:24:32,700
Uncle Hao,

380
00:24:33,040 --> 00:24:34,776
you seem to be living comfortably.

381
00:24:34,800 --> 00:24:37,256
Have you nearly forgotten
whose gambling house this is?

382
00:24:37,280 --> 00:24:38,776
Master,

383
00:24:38,800 --> 00:24:40,896
how could you say that?

384
00:24:40,920 --> 00:24:43,016
I would never dare forget

385
00:24:43,040 --> 00:24:45,980
that our gang leader is the true
owner of this gambling house.

386
00:24:46,520 --> 00:24:48,696
Business has simply been
booming these past few days,

387
00:24:48,720 --> 00:24:49,856
so I thought

388
00:24:49,880 --> 00:24:51,300
I would relax a little.

389
00:24:51,800 --> 00:24:52,940
By the way, Master,

390
00:24:55,080 --> 00:24:57,176
this is the gambling house's recent income.

391
00:24:57,200 --> 00:24:58,700
Please inspect it.

392
00:25:02,800 --> 00:25:03,940
Not bad.

393
00:25:04,920 --> 00:25:06,496
With the gambling house in your hands,

394
00:25:06,520 --> 00:25:07,940
I can rest assured.

395
00:25:08,280 --> 00:25:09,420
But Uncle Hao,

396
00:25:09,960 --> 00:25:12,136
as your purse grows heavier,

397
00:25:12,160 --> 00:25:13,896
you must not forget the rules.

398
00:25:13,920 --> 00:25:15,936
How could I dare forget?

399
00:25:15,960 --> 00:25:18,736
I was just thinking of offering
more to the gang leader.

400
00:25:18,760 --> 00:25:19,896
By the way, Master,

401
00:25:19,920 --> 00:25:22,976
if the gambling house in the
eastern city also comes under me,

402
00:25:23,000 --> 00:25:25,016
you will certainly receive your share.

403
00:25:25,040 --> 00:25:26,740
Please wait, Master.

404
00:25:33,840 --> 00:25:35,060
Master.

405
00:25:38,000 --> 00:25:39,220
Master.

406
00:25:42,600 --> 00:25:43,740
There is one more matter.

407
00:25:44,160 --> 00:25:45,936
Recently, the Bureau...

408
00:25:45,960 --> 00:25:47,260
Uncle Hao.

409
00:25:48,000 --> 00:25:49,140
Uncle Hao.

410
00:25:50,480 --> 00:25:51,620
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

411
00:25:52,040 --> 00:25:53,016
How many times have I told you

412
00:25:53,040 --> 00:25:54,456
to knock before entering?

413
00:25:54,480 --> 00:25:55,376
Yes.

414
00:25:55,400 --> 00:25:56,936
I'll go knock right now.

415
00:25:56,960 --> 00:25:58,100
Come back.

416
00:26:04,480 --> 00:26:06,416
Speak. What is it?

417
00:26:06,440 --> 00:26:08,896
If it is not something important,

418
00:26:08,920 --> 00:26:10,056
I'll skin you alive.

419
00:26:10,080 --> 00:26:11,176
Uncle Hao,

420
00:26:11,200 --> 00:26:13,820
this is Old Zhai, the gatekeeper.

421
00:26:15,320 --> 00:26:17,340
He says he has secret
information to report.

422
00:26:18,600 --> 00:26:19,740
Secret information?

423
00:26:20,640 --> 00:26:22,060
Uncle Hao...

424
00:26:22,480 --> 00:26:24,020
You are only a gatekeeper.

425
00:26:24,360 --> 00:26:25,896
A mere gatekeeper.

426
00:26:25,920 --> 00:26:27,176
What secret could you possibly know?

427
00:26:27,200 --> 00:26:28,776
-Uncle Hao.
-Why are all these nobodies

428
00:26:28,800 --> 00:26:30,296
being brought to me?

429
00:26:30,320 --> 00:26:32,096
Do you think this is a teahouse?

430
00:26:32,120 --> 00:26:33,896
Uncle Hao...

431
00:26:33,920 --> 00:26:35,496
Meng Tinghui from the Bureau

432
00:26:35,520 --> 00:26:37,056
brought a man to the second floor.

433
00:26:37,080 --> 00:26:38,576
-They have come with hostile intentions.
-You are just a gatekeeper.

434
00:26:38,600 --> 00:26:40,060
Are you certain it was her?

435
00:26:40,680 --> 00:26:41,860
Wait.

436
00:26:43,360 --> 00:26:45,896
People from the Bureau have recently been

437
00:26:45,920 --> 00:26:48,536
secretly investigating the gang
leader and me on Changle Street.

438
00:26:48,560 --> 00:26:50,576
Tell your men to stay alert.

439
00:26:50,600 --> 00:26:51,976
Do not let her find any evidence.

440
00:26:52,000 --> 00:26:54,220
They must not discover the
secret of the second floor.

441
00:26:54,680 --> 00:26:55,576
I'll handle it at once.

442
00:26:55,600 --> 00:26:57,780
Go.

443
00:27:24,200 --> 00:27:25,136
Honored guests,

444
00:27:25,160 --> 00:27:27,020
going any farther would violate the rules.

445
00:28:01,320 --> 00:28:02,620
It's A-Yue.

446
00:29:10,440 --> 00:29:11,900
A-Yue.

447
00:29:13,160 --> 00:29:15,136
-She is still breathing.
-There was movement just now.

448
00:29:15,160 --> 00:29:16,456
Where did they go? Find them.

449
00:29:16,480 --> 00:29:17,376
Go.

450
00:29:17,400 --> 00:29:19,060
Go.

451
00:29:40,000 --> 00:29:41,140
You...

452
00:29:44,360 --> 00:29:45,540
You are...

453
00:29:46,400 --> 00:29:48,380
the female Top Scholar who
placed first in all three exams.

454
00:29:49,080 --> 00:29:50,660
Official Meng.

455
00:29:51,120 --> 00:29:52,736
You saved me.

456
00:29:52,760 --> 00:29:54,660
A-Gui asked us to save you.

457
00:29:55,080 --> 00:29:56,220
A-Gui...

458
00:29:57,360 --> 00:29:58,500
Where is he?

459
00:30:01,200 --> 00:30:03,296
A-Gui risked his life trying to save you.

460
00:30:03,320 --> 00:30:05,540
He wanted you to live well.

461
00:30:12,040 --> 00:30:13,540
A-Gui.

462
00:30:18,680 --> 00:30:20,300
I caused this.

463
00:30:21,880 --> 00:30:24,336
I got you killed.

464
00:30:24,360 --> 00:30:26,016
You are very weak.

465
00:30:26,040 --> 00:30:27,540
Do not grieve too deeply.

466
00:30:27,880 --> 00:30:29,336
Whatever injustice you suffered,

467
00:30:29,360 --> 00:30:31,336
-tell Official Meng everything.
-That's right.

468
00:30:31,360 --> 00:30:33,580
My lady will obtain justice for you.

469
00:30:36,920 --> 00:30:38,776
We were

470
00:30:38,800 --> 00:30:41,540
female scholars preparing for
the next imperial examination.

471
00:30:43,160 --> 00:30:44,536
We came from poor and remote regions.

472
00:30:44,560 --> 00:30:47,340
Fortunately, His Majesty
reopened the women's examination,

473
00:30:47,840 --> 00:30:49,940
and Official Meng firmly
defended the decision.

474
00:30:50,280 --> 00:30:52,460
Only then did ordinary women like us

475
00:30:52,880 --> 00:30:54,260
see a path forward.

476
00:30:54,680 --> 00:30:55,820
Later,

477
00:30:56,280 --> 00:30:59,100
someone claimed to be an instructor
from the capital's women's academy

478
00:30:59,760 --> 00:31:02,056
and selected talented
women from every prefecture

479
00:31:02,080 --> 00:31:03,660
to study further in the capital.

480
00:31:04,400 --> 00:31:06,136
We believed them.

481
00:31:06,160 --> 00:31:07,500
But after reaching the capital,

482
00:31:08,240 --> 00:31:10,656
we were imprisoned in a residence.

483
00:31:10,680 --> 00:31:13,856
At first, they taught us music,
chess, calligraphy, and painting.

484
00:31:13,880 --> 00:31:15,456
Those who performed well were taken away

485
00:31:15,480 --> 00:31:17,056
and never heard from again.

486
00:31:17,080 --> 00:31:18,420
At the same time,

487
00:31:18,960 --> 00:31:20,700
new female scholars

488
00:31:21,160 --> 00:31:22,176
kept arriving at the residence.

489
00:31:22,200 --> 00:31:23,620
A-Yue,

490
00:31:25,600 --> 00:31:27,136
where in the capital is that residence?

491
00:31:27,160 --> 00:31:29,380
From our homes to the capital,

492
00:31:30,200 --> 00:31:31,336
they kept us inside

493
00:31:31,360 --> 00:31:33,496
sealed carriages with no view outside.

494
00:31:33,520 --> 00:31:34,456
After reaching the residence,

495
00:31:34,480 --> 00:31:36,256
we were never allowed to leave.

496
00:31:36,280 --> 00:31:38,060
How long have you been here?

497
00:31:39,360 --> 00:31:41,336
And how did you meet A-Gui?

498
00:31:41,360 --> 00:31:44,060
I came to the capital
over three months ago.

499
00:31:45,280 --> 00:31:46,660
By chance, I recognized A-Gui

500
00:31:47,000 --> 00:31:49,260
when he delivered
vegetables to the residence.

501
00:31:51,080 --> 00:31:52,460
From him,

502
00:31:52,960 --> 00:31:54,300
I learned

503
00:31:55,840 --> 00:31:57,940
that the female scholars
who were taken away

504
00:31:59,640 --> 00:32:02,336
were all sent to the second
floor of the gambling house.

505
00:32:02,360 --> 00:32:03,416
They were used as wagers

506
00:32:03,440 --> 00:32:06,580
for the gamblers' amusement.

507
00:32:08,120 --> 00:32:09,616
Those gamblers

508
00:32:09,640 --> 00:32:11,980
were twisted perverts.

509
00:32:12,760 --> 00:32:14,460
They treated women as playthings

510
00:32:14,760 --> 00:32:16,340
and used cruel methods.

511
00:32:17,440 --> 00:32:19,216
Only because of A-Gui

512
00:32:19,240 --> 00:32:22,180
was I able to avoid being
sent upstairs for so long.

513
00:32:23,280 --> 00:32:25,420
Did none of you try to escape?

514
00:32:29,520 --> 00:32:30,660
We did.

515
00:32:31,600 --> 00:32:32,980
We also reported it to the authorities.

516
00:32:34,760 --> 00:32:37,220
But the officials were working with them.

517
00:32:38,520 --> 00:32:40,856
Those who escaped were captured again,

518
00:32:40,880 --> 00:32:42,416
had their hands and feet cut off,

519
00:32:42,440 --> 00:32:44,220
and were tortured to death.

520
00:32:44,840 --> 00:32:47,700
Many female scholars could
not bear the humiliation

521
00:32:48,760 --> 00:32:50,820
and chose to take their own lives.

522
00:32:52,920 --> 00:32:55,340
Do you know which court officials

523
00:32:56,440 --> 00:32:58,340
were colluding with them?

524
00:33:02,200 --> 00:33:03,896
And who captured you?

525
00:33:03,920 --> 00:33:05,980
I only heard

526
00:33:07,320 --> 00:33:09,180
someone called Master Lü.

527
00:33:16,800 --> 00:33:17,776
He is Lü Er's elder brother.

528
00:33:17,800 --> 00:33:19,576
I saw him before.

529
00:33:19,600 --> 00:33:21,216
Do you know anything about

530
00:33:21,240 --> 00:33:22,780
the identities of the guests upstairs,

531
00:33:23,400 --> 00:33:25,380
especially the men who took you away?

532
00:33:26,080 --> 00:33:27,220
They...

533
00:33:28,200 --> 00:33:29,656
all wore masks.

534
00:33:29,680 --> 00:33:31,220
I only remember

535
00:33:32,320 --> 00:33:34,420
that one man wore a red jade thumb ring

536
00:33:34,840 --> 00:33:36,576
engraved with a bird in a cage.

537
00:33:36,600 --> 00:33:37,980
Last night

538
00:33:39,080 --> 00:33:40,740
was the first time I was taken...

539
00:33:42,280 --> 00:33:43,420
taken...

540
00:33:45,840 --> 00:33:47,740
A-Yue.

541
00:33:52,240 --> 00:33:53,620
Official Meng,

542
00:33:54,600 --> 00:33:55,900
thank you.

543
00:33:57,520 --> 00:33:58,900
I know

544
00:33:59,800 --> 00:34:01,340
the condition of my own body.

545
00:34:03,280 --> 00:34:04,900
There is no time left.

546
00:34:14,000 --> 00:34:15,220
Listen.

547
00:34:16,680 --> 00:34:18,740
That is the sound of studying.

548
00:34:57,080 --> 00:34:58,980
Kingdoms and states

549
00:34:59,280 --> 00:35:00,820
may be governed.

550
00:35:01,800 --> 00:35:02,980
Rank and wealth

551
00:35:03,800 --> 00:35:05,296
may be refused.

552
00:35:05,320 --> 00:35:06,700
Bare blades

553
00:35:07,600 --> 00:35:09,060
may be trodden upon.

554
00:35:10,880 --> 00:35:12,100
But the Doctrine of the Mean

555
00:35:13,480 --> 00:35:15,140
cannot be attained.

556
00:36:05,240 --> 00:36:06,580
A-Yue.

557
00:36:07,120 --> 00:36:08,340
I'm here.

558
00:36:15,120 --> 00:36:16,380
I'll take you away.

559
00:36:38,640 --> 00:36:40,420
A-Gui.

560
00:36:46,440 --> 00:36:47,740
A-Yue.

561
00:36:48,720 --> 00:36:49,900
-A-Yue.
-Official Meng.

562
00:36:52,080 --> 00:36:53,456
Official Meng,

563
00:36:53,480 --> 00:36:55,260
how I wished

564
00:36:56,560 --> 00:36:58,060
I could be like you,

565
00:36:59,960 --> 00:37:01,300
study,

566
00:37:02,960 --> 00:37:04,220
take the examination,

567
00:37:05,440 --> 00:37:06,740
and earn...

568
00:37:07,720 --> 00:37:09,220
honor.

569
00:37:16,840 --> 00:37:18,220
A-Yue.

570
00:37:21,080 --> 00:37:22,220
A-Yue.

571
00:37:44,040 --> 00:37:45,580
A-Yue.

572
00:37:46,480 --> 00:37:48,740
I will make those criminals

573
00:37:51,440 --> 00:37:53,740
repay this blood debt with their lives.

574
00:38:08,640 --> 00:38:10,536
Those gamblers spent lavishly.

575
00:38:10,560 --> 00:38:11,980
They must have powerful backgrounds.

576
00:38:13,160 --> 00:38:15,180
And those women received
no help after reporting it,

577
00:38:15,520 --> 00:38:16,856
which means that among the gamblers

578
00:38:16,880 --> 00:38:18,380
