581
00:38:22,080 --> 00:38:23,976
and used it as leverage

582
00:38:24,000 --> 00:38:25,900
to turn them into their protectors.

583
00:38:29,960 --> 00:38:32,620
Those women had great ambitions.

584
00:38:33,720 --> 00:38:35,900
They wanted to serve the imperial court,

585
00:38:36,960 --> 00:38:38,656
but they were dragged into
the filth of officialdom

586
00:38:38,680 --> 00:38:40,136
and had their entire lives destroyed.

587
00:38:40,160 --> 00:38:41,740
The most absurd part

588
00:38:43,840 --> 00:38:45,620
is that these murderers

589
00:38:47,000 --> 00:38:48,740
sit in positions of power

590
00:38:49,240 --> 00:38:50,700
and act without restraint.

591
00:39:20,920 --> 00:39:22,500
Whether it is the Tiger Roar Gang

592
00:39:23,760 --> 00:39:25,420
or those corrupt officials,

593
00:39:26,520 --> 00:39:27,776
I will drag every one of you

594
00:39:27,800 --> 00:39:29,900
